[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0010","text":"────堵车是吗……\n好的，我知道了……我会等的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0020","text":"咦……\n……朝日？　爱依──？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0030","text":"刨冰做好啦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0040","text":"哇，这程度简直想浇糖浆了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0050","text":"又在干些无聊的事……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0060","text":"制作人好像要迟到了\n说让我们等十分钟左右"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0070","text":"好嘞／了解～♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0080","text":"……还有，不可以吃雪哦？\n会吃坏肚子的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0090","text":"冬优子，你吃过雪吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800400_03_0100","text":"想想就知道了♡"}]
